   <accessor type='XPath' value='byXPath(&quot;//main[@id=&apos;root&apos;]/article/main/article/section[3]/div[2]/div/table/tbody/tr[1]/td[8]/div/span&quot;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
   <accessor type='XPathClass' value='byXPath(&apos;//*[@class=&quot;inline-flex text-center items-center border rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 max-w-fit whitespace-nowrap bg-neutral-foreground hover:bg-neutral-foreground/80 border-transparent text-foreground uppercase hover:opacity-70&quot;]&apos;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
   <accessor type='XPathText' value='byXPath(&apos;//*[text()=&quot;ACTIVE&quot;]&apos;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
   <accessor type='AbsoluteXPath' value='byXPath(&apos;/html/body/main/article/main/article/section[3]/div[2]/div/table/tbody/tr/td[8]/div/span&apos;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
   <accessor type='RelativeXPath' value='byXPath(&quot;id(&apos;root&apos;)/article[@class=&apos;flex min-h-screen flex-col&apos;]/main[@class=&apos;break-word flex-1 overflow-auto bg-background px-6 py-4 md:ml-16&apos;]/article[@class=&apos;w-full flex-1 bg-background&apos;]/section[@class=&apos;space-y-2&apos;]/div[@class=&apos;rounded-md border&apos;]/div[@class=&apos;w-full overflow-auto rounded-lg bg-root&apos;]/table[@class=&apos;w-full caption-bottom font-mono text-sm&apos;]/tbody[@class=&apos;[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0&apos;]/tr[@class=&apos;border-b transition-colors hover:bg-accent/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-accent&apos;]/td[@class=&apos;break-words p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0&apos;]/div[@class=&apos;w-48&apos;]/span[@class=&apos;inline-flex text-center items-center border rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 max-w-fit whitespace-nowrap bg-neutral-foreground hover:bg-neutral-foreground/80 border-transparent text-foreground uppercase hover:opacity-70&apos;]&quot;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
   <accessor type='TableXPath' value='byXPath(&apos;//tbody//tr[1]//td[8]//div//span[@class=&quot;inline-flex text-center items-center border rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 max-w-fit whitespace-nowrap bg-neutral-foreground hover:bg-neutral-foreground/80 border-transparent text-foreground uppercase hover:opacity-70&quot;]&apos;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
   <accessor type='TableXPath' value='byXPath(&apos;//tbody//tr[1]//td[8]//div//span[text()=&quot;ACTIVE&quot;]&apos;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
   <accessor type='JQuery' value='byJQuery(&apos;tbody[class=&quot;[&amp;_tr:last-child]:border-0&quot;] &gt; tr[class=&quot;border-b transition-colors hover:bg-accent/50 data-[state=selected]:bg-accent&quot;] &gt; td[class=&quot;break-words p-4 align-middle [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0&quot;] &gt; div[class=&quot;w-48&quot;] &gt; span[class=&quot;inline-flex text-center items-center border rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 max-w-fit whitespace-nowrap bg-neutral-foreground hover:bg-neutral-foreground/80 border-transparent text-foreground uppercase hover:opacity-70&quot;]&apos;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
   <accessor type='AttrClass' value='span(&quot;bg-neutral-foreground border border-transparent focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-ring font-bold hover:bg-neutral-foreground/80 hover:opacity-70 inline-flex items-center max-w-fit px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full text-center text-foreground text-xs transition-colors uppercase whitespace-nowrap&quot;)' fallback='true' selected='false'/>
